    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFANTASTIC LARGE FOUR BEDROOM DETACHED HOME\n\nSavills are delighted to present Carrigeen, an exceptional four-bedroom detached residence extending to approximately 2,626 sq ft and standing on a beautifully landscaped site of approximately 0.667 acres, just 2 kilometres from the popular village of Belgooly. Completely renovated to an exceptionally high standard in 2022, this superb home combines generous proportions with the comfort, efficiency and specification of a modern property. Beautifully presented throughout and finished to almost showhouse standard, Carrigeen is an outstanding turnkey family home in a highly convenient location.\n\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and exceptionally well appointed. A wide and welcoming entrance hall with engineered oak flooring leads to a comfortable lounge with bay window and electric fire, together with a larger second reception room featuring a solid fuel stove, built-in shelving and garden access. The impressive kitchen/dining room is fitted with a contemporary Cube kitchen, Silestone worktops and a comprehensive range of appliances. A useful rear hall, guest WC and separate utility room complete the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, the generous landing leads to four exceptionally spacious double bedrooms, all enjoying excellent natural light, built-in wardrobes and attractive views over the gardens and surrounding countryside. The principal bedroom benefits from a luxurious en suite with solid marble tiling. The main bathroom is similarly finished with marble tiling and provides both bath and separate shower facilities. Bespoke fitted wardrobes by Cullenview Interiors and excellent storage throughout further enhance the practicality of the home.\n\nCarrigeen underwent a comprehensive renovation in 2022, including a new roof, plumbing, electrical installation, windows, heating system and radiators, as well as new flooring, bathrooms and kitchen. An air-to-water heating system and A-rated BER provide excellent energy efficiency. Further investment in 2026 included the installation of 18 solar panels and a 10kWh battery storage system. High-speed broadband, alarm, automated gates and a Zappi EV charger complete the modern specification.\n\nThe grounds are a particular feature of Carrigeen, approached through automated gates onto a cobblelock driveway. The detached 6m x 6m garage provides excellent space for storage, hobbies or workshop use, with potential for future conversion, subject to planning. The beautifully landscaped gardens include lawns, mature flowerbeds, patio and established trees, while the south/south-westerly rear aspect enjoys excellent sunshine, privacy and attractive countryside views.\n\nBelgooly village is approximately 2 kilometres away, with Kinsale 8 kilometres and Carrigaline 11 kilometres. Cork City, UCC and CUH are approximately 2122 kilometres away, while Old Head Golf Links is approximately 21 kilometres. Carrigeen offers an exceptional combination of peaceful country living, excellent accessibility and outstanding presentation, making it an ideal family home or relocation property."
      },
